## 2. Backend — ESL Command Layer (freeswitch.service.ts)

**14 ESL commands** — every one uses `ensureConnection()` guard + real FreeSWITCH API:

| # | Method | ESL Command | Lines |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `originateCall()` | `bgapi originate {cid}user/{ext} &bridge(sofia/gateway/...)` | 156-172 |
| 2 | `bridgeCall()` | `uuid_bridge {uuid1} {uuid2}` | 175-178 |
| 3 | `playAudio()` | `uuid_broadcast {uuid} {file} aleg` | 180-183 |
| 4 | `hangup()` | `uuid_kill {uuid}` | 185-188 |
| 5 | `transfer()` | `uuid_transfer {uuid} {ext}` | 190-193 |
| 6 | `muteCall()` | `uuid_audio {uuid} start/stop read mute` | 196-200 |
| 7 | `holdCall()` | `uuid_hold {uuid}` | 203-206 |
| 8 | `unholdCall()` | `uuid_hold off {uuid}` | 209-212 |
| 9 | `startRecording()` | `uuid_record {uuid} start {path}` | 215-218 |
| 10 | `stopRecording()` | `uuid_record {uuid} stop {path}` | 221-224 |
| 11 | `eavesdropWhisper()` | `originate user/{ext}@{dom} &eavesdrop({uuid})` | 227-233 |
| 12 | `bargeIn()` | `uuid_transfer` to conf + `originate` supervisor | 235-246 |
| 13 | `silentMonitor()` | `originate {whisper_aleg=false,whisper_bleg=false}...&eavesdrop` | 248-256 |
| 14 | `sendDtmf()` | `uuid_send_dtmf {uuid} {digits}@{duration}` | 258-262 |

**Connection resilience:**
- ✅ `_isConnected` boolean + `!!this.connection` dual check
- ✅ Exponential backoff reconnection: `1s → 2s → 4s → ... → 30s` (max 10 attempts)
- ✅ `OnModuleInit` → auto-connect, `OnModuleDestroy` → cleanup
- ✅ 5 ESL events subscribed: `CHANNEL_ANSWER`, `CHANNEL_HANGUP`, `CHANNEL_BRIDGE`, `RECORD_START`, `RECORD_STOP`
- ✅ All events emit via `EventEmitter2` for cross-module consumption

**Verdict: ✅ 100% — Zero stubs, zero mocks**

