## 3. Backend — Orchestration (telephony.service.ts)

**17 methods** — all delegate to real `FreeswitchService`:

| Method | Delegates To | DB Action |
|---|---|---|
| `isConnected` | `freeswitch.isConnected` | — |
| `initiateCall()` | `freeswitch.originateCall()` | `prisma.call.create` |
| `transferCall()` | `freeswitch.transfer()` | — |
| `hangupCall()` | `freeswitch.hangup()` | `prisma.call.updateMany → COMPLETED` |
| `muteCall()` | `freeswitch.muteCall()` | — |
| `holdCall()` | `freeswitch.holdCall/unholdCall()` | — |
| `whisperToAgent()` | `freeswitch.eavesdropWhisper()` | — |
| `bargeIn()` | `freeswitch.bargeIn()` | — |
| `silentMonitor()` | `freeswitch.silentMonitor()` | — |
| `sendDtmf()` | `freeswitch.sendDtmf()` | — |
| `startRecording()` | `freeswitch.startRecording()` | — |
| `stopRecording()` | `freeswitch.stopRecording()` | — |
| `markCallAnswered()` | — | `prisma.call.updateMany → CONNECTED` |
| `getSipConfig()` | — | `prisma.user.findFirst` for extension/sipPassword |
| `getTurnCredentials()` | — | Returns from `process.env` |
| `voicemailDrop()` | `freeswitch.playAudio()` | — |
| `saveLocation()` | — | `prisma.agentLocation.create` |

**Security: TURN credentials read from env vars** (`TURN_USERNAME`, `TURN_PASSWORD`)

**Verdict: ✅ 100% — Complete delegation, proper tenant scoping**

