## 16. Data Flow Diagram

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Browser (Next.js)"
        UI["Softphone UI<br/>277 lines"]
        Hook["useSoftphone<br/>338 lines"]
        Store["useCallStore<br/>82 lines"]
        UI --> Hook
        Hook --> Store
    end

    subgraph "SIP.js WebRTC"
        WS_SIP["WSS :7443<br/>SIP Signaling"]
        SRTP["SRTP<br/>Media Stream"]
    end

    subgraph "Backend (NestJS)"
        API["REST Controller<br/>17 endpoints"]
        GW["WS Gateway<br/>14 events"]
        SVC["TelephonyService<br/>17 methods"]
        ESL["FreeswitchService<br/>14 ESL commands"]
        DIALER["DialerProcessor<br/>BullMQ"]
        PACE["PacingService<br/>TCPA-compliant"]
    end

    subgraph "FreeSWITCH"
        FS["FreeSWITCH<br/>ESL :8021"]
        PSTN["PSTN / SIP Trunk"]
    end

    subgraph "Database"
        DB["PostgreSQL<br/>Call, Extension, CallSpool"]
    end

    Hook <-->|"SIP REGISTER/INVITE"| WS_SIP
    Hook <-->|"Audio RTP"| SRTP
    WS_SIP --- FS
    SRTP --- FS
    UI -->|"REST"| API
    UI <-->|"Socket.io"| GW
    API --> SVC
    GW --> SVC
    SVC --> ESL
    ESL <-->|"TCP :8021"| FS
    FS --> PSTN
    SVC --> DB
    DIALER --> ESL
    PACE -->|"@OnEvent"| ESL
```

