**The FreeSWITCH telephony integration is 100% code-complete.** Every layer from ESL commands → NestJS services → WebSocket signaling → REST API → SIP.js WebRTC → React UI is fully wired, type-safe, and compiles cleanly. Deploy a FreeSWITCH server instance to go live.
